re of the intended functionality, but it seems like `TimestampSigner.validate` should not raise any exceptions. If the timestamp is older than the max age, the function should return `False` rather than raise an exception.\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/11/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/11/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/33", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/itsdangerous", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/33/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/33/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/33/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/pallets/itsdangerous/pull/33", "id": 32455700, "node_id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MTUyOTQ2NTQ=", "number": 33, "title": "Fix a typo in TimestampSigner class description.", "user": {"login": "baubie", "id": 292411, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjQxMQ==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292411?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/baubie", "html_url": "https://github.com/baubie", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/baubie/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/baubie/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/baubie/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/baubie/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/baubie/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/baubie/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/baubie/repos", "events_url": "https://api.githu